      "text": "```\nARTHROPODA — ~1.1 million described species\n= 80–85% of all described animal species"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-ARTHROPODA.md#003",
      "path": [
        "06-ARTHROPODA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
