        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Arthropoda - The Most Species-Rich Phylum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DEFINING FEATURES:\n  Segmented body\n  Jointed appendages (one per segment ancestrally)\n  Rigid exoskeleton (cuticle: chitin + proteins)\n  Hemocoel (open circulatory system)\n  Moulting (ecdysis) to grow"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-ARTHROPODA.md#004",
      "path": [
        "06-ARTHROPODA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
