      },
      "text": "ARTHROPOD TREE:\n                    ARTHROPODA\n           +----------+----------+\n           |          |          |\n       Chelicerata  Myriapoda  Pancrustacea\n       (arachnids, (centipedes, +---+---+\n        horseshoe   millipedes) |       |\n        crabs)                Crustacea Hexapoda\n                              (shrimp,  (insects)\n                               crabs)"
    },
    {
