        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Arthropoda - The Most Species-Rich Phylum",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CHITIN: β-1,4-linked N-acetylglucosamine polymer\n  Crystalline microfibrils embedded in protein matrix\n  Light but strong (tensile strength ~ mild steel relative to weight)\n  Flexible at joints (endocuticle only, no sclerotization)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-ARTHROPODA.md#012",
      "path": [
        "06-ARTHROPODA.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
